<title>UK: WestLB unit sets A$100 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB unit sets A$100 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros Bank (books) and WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTLB FINANCE (CURACAO) NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    22.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
